'''Anger Management''' (アンガーマネジメント, ''Angā Manejimento'', '''Anger Management''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (M): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +2.

